Z||000000||billfredmike24||09-16-2001||12:06 AM||||I was wondering if any one had a copy of the leather seat cover installion video they could send me, i'd like to remove the covers off my seats, to see what kind of shape they're in underneath.<P>Or could someone explain how to remove the seat covers to me.  Detailed would be greatly appreciated.<BR>TIA MIke<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigt_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||FieroRyan||09-16-2001||01:04 AM||||The Mr. Mikes video won't help you in that respect, he tells you to cut the old covers up the middle to save time.<p>[This message has been edited by FieroRyan (edited 09-16-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||AusFiero||09-16-2001||04:06 AM||||???? Cutting them. So how is it people sell second hand seat covers???<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
Z||000003||Monkeyman||09-16-2001||06:53 AM||||You don't have to cut them.  It's much, much easier that way, but it can be done without a knife.  I hope to get some of Mr. Mikes sport seat covers in the next couple of months.  I'll remove my stock seat covers intact as they're in great shape (other than needing a good cleaning).  Just roll them up like a condom.<P>------------------<BR>In memory of those that died on 11 Sept 2001.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1367.gif">  <BR>Monkeyman||||reg||1
Z||000004||FieroRyan||09-16-2001||07:13 AM||||Hmm.  Then the Mr. Mikes video won't help you anyway, as he tells you to cut them.  That's gonna be a pain in the ass to roll it up and remove all the ring things (forgot their correct name), but now that I think about it it is definately possible.  <P>Getting the rings off the metal rod's on the side w/o cutting it will probably be the hardest part, if I remember how the seat was setup correctly...  After that there's only 1 more row of them (Theres 3 rows and 2 rod's you haveto take out and re-secure later).||||reg||1
